<dl>
<dt>Parameters:
<dd><dl><dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">oAttacker<dd>the creature whose attack damage effect we are retrieving<dt style="font-weight:normal; font-style:italic;">nDamageEffectId<dd>the id of the damage effect to get (this id is passed in the ATTACK_IMPACT event)
</dl>
</dl><dl><dt>Returns:
